    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n42415" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐρί-γδουπος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b>
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐρίδουπος</span>
			 (q.v.), <i>loud-sounding, thundering,</i> in <i><span class="en">
				Hom.
			</span></i> epith. of Zeus, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Διὸς υἱὸν ἐριγδούποιο</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Il.
					5.672
				</span></i>
			 ; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐ. πόσις Ἥρης</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Od.
					15.112
				</span></i>
			 ; exc. in <i><span class="en">
				Il.
				11.152
			</span></i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐ. πόδες ἵππων ;</span> so after <i><span class="en">
				Hom.
			</span></i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Ναΐδων ἐ. στοναχαί</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pi.
					<u>Dith.Oxy.</u>
					2.12
				</span></i>
			 ; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">καλαῦροψ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>APl.</u>
					4.74
				</span></i>
			 ; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">βοείη</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Nonn.
					<u>D.</u>
					18.105
				</span></i>
			.</div>
